        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And about the time that Ammaron hid up the records unto the Lord, he came unto me, (I being about ten years of age, and I began to be learned somewhat after the manner of the learning of my people) and Ammaron said unto me: I perceive that thou art a sober child, and art quick to observe;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "4 Ne. 1:48 (47–49)."
          },
          {
            "start": 134,
            "end": 141,
            "text": "Enos 1:1; Mosiah 1:3 (3–5)."
          },
          {
            "start": 251,
            "end": 256,
            "text": "TG Sobriety; Trustworthiness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [
