        "book": "The Book of Mormon",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, when ye are about twenty and four years old I would that ye should remember the things that ye have observed concerning this people; and when ye are of that age go to the land Antum, unto a hill which shall be called Shim; and there have I deposited unto the Lord all the sacred engravings concerning this people.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 182,
            "end": 192,
            "text": "Morm. 2:17."
          },
          {
            "start": 228,
            "end": 232,
            "text": "Morm. 4:23; Ether 9:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
