        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And I did endeavor to preach unto this people, but my mouth was shut, and I was forbidden that I should preach unto them; for behold they had wilfully rebelled against their God; and the beloved disciples were taken away out of the land, because of their iniquity.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 142,
            "end": 159,
            "text": "4 Ne. 1:38. TG Rebellion."
          },
          {
            "start": 210,
