        "book": "The Book of Mormon",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "But I did remain among them, but I was forbidden to preach unto them, because of the hardness of their hearts; and because of the hardness of their hearts the land was cursed for their sake.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "Micah 3:6 (5–7)."
          },
          {
            "start": 168,
            "end": 174,
            "text": "2 Ne. 1:7; Alma 45:16 (10–14, 16); Ether 2:11 (8–12)."
